{"id":"n86969-3-7","stage":4,"title":"회전 · 转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86969-3-7-1","ko":"여기에서 회전을 할까요?","zh":"我们在这里转弯吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회전을","meaning":"转，转向，转弯","explanation":"회전：转，转向，转弯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회전","audio":"/audio/96bc626612e32b76a9fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86969","senseId":"3","lemma":"회전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96bc626612e32b76","term":"회전","zh":"转，转向，转弯","audio":"/audio/96bc626612e32b76a9fb.mp3","entryId":"86969","definition":"改变方向。","pronunciation":["회전","훼전"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2a53fd871459e0f97ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86969-3-7-2","ko":"아니요. 다음 사거리에서 오른쪽으로 도시면 돼요.","zh":"不用。在下一个十字路口向右转就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사거리에서","meaning":"十字路口","explanation":"사거리：十字路口；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사거리","audio":"/audio/9c9e79138d8d4fe75dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88600","senseId":"1","lemma":"사거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른쪽으로","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도시면","meaning":"转，拐","explanation":"돌다：转，拐；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"19","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"9c9e79138d8d4fe7","term":"사거리","zh":"十字路口","audio":"/audio/9c9e79138d8d4fe75dee.mp3","entryId":"88600","definition":"道路被分成四个方向的地方。","pronunciation":["사ː거리"]},{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人面向北边时和东边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["오른쪽"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"转，拐","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"沿着路改变方向。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/82040db112eb42c6fd26.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.065,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86969","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":1.8917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们在这里转弯吗？","不用。在下一个十字路口向右转就可以了。","东西很重，用双手接住吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们在这里转弯吗？","不用。在下一个十字路口向右转就可以了。","东西很重，用双手接住吧。"],"answer":1}]}
